<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#241b4b"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Financial Planning for Contractors & Business Owners | RIPL Wealth</title><meta name="description" content="Your business has a general contractor. Your money should too. RIPL Wealth coordinates investments, tax-aware planning and your financial team."/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Libre+Baskerville:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="header"><div class="wrap nav"><a href="#main" class="brand" aria-label="RIPL Wealth — top"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" alt="RIPL" width="112" height="48"/><small>BUILD TOMORROW TODAY.</small></a><nav aria-label="Primary"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#about">Meet Adam</a><a class="nav-cta" href="#tax-evaluation">Free tax evaluation ↗</a></nav></div></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="video-slot" id="intro-video"><div class="video-placeholder"><span class="play-circle" aria-hidden="true">▶</span><strong>Meet Adam · A quick introduction</strong><span>Intro video coming soon</span></div></div><div class="video-actions" aria-label="Three ways to start"><a class="button primary" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="tax">Request a free tax evaluation ↗</a><a class="button outline" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Schedule a 30-minute call →</a><a class="button text-button" href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com?subject=Question%20for%20Adam%20at%20RIPL" data-email>Email Adam a question →</a><p class="micro">No documents needed to start. We’ll arrange secure sharing after we connect, if appropriate.</p></div><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="line"></span> FINANCIAL PLANNING FOR CONTRACTORS & BUSINESS OWNERS</p><h1 id="hero-title">Your business has a general contractor. <em>Your money should too.</em></h1><p class="lead">RIPL helps business owners pay less tax on purpose, grow their money in a way that makes sense for them, and get their CPA, insurance, estate plan and investments working from one set of blueprints.</p><div class="stack hero-desktop-actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="tax">Request a free tax evaluation ↗</a><a class="button outline" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Schedule a 30-minute call →</a><a class="button text-button" href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com?subject=Question%20for%20Adam%20at%20RIPL" data-email>Email Adam a question →</a></div><p class="micro">Free. No obligation. We work alongside your CPA. No tax return is needed for your first call.</p><a href="#quiz" class="hero-quiz-link">Or take the private 2-minute quiz ↓</a></div></section>
<section class="who wrap"><div class="who-image"><img src="/money-at-work/images/team.webp" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" alt="The RIPL Wealth team in their office"/></div><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR FINANCIAL GENERAL CONTRACTOR</p><h2>You've got good people. <em>Who's running the job?</em></h2><p>On a job site, the general contractor keeps every trade working off one set of blueprints. Your CPA, insurance agent, estate attorney and investment adviser each know their part. But who's making sure the pieces fit together?</p><p><strong>That's our job.</strong> We coordinate the work, bring in specialists when they're needed, and stay on it as your business grows.</p></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="pillars"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE FOUNDATION</p><h2>Safe first. <em>Grow second.</em></h2></div><div class="pillar-grid"><article class="pillar safe"><span class="pill-label">01 / FOUNDATION</span><h3>Safe first.</h3><p>Before we chase a single point of return, we make sure what you've built is protected. Right amount of cash. Right coverage. No bets you can't afford to lose.</p></article><article class="pillar grow"><span class="pill-label">02 / BUILD</span><h3>Grow second.</h3><p>Once the foundation is poured, we put the rest of your money to work, with returns that fit your goals and your timeline, not someone else's benchmark.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section how-bg" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A STRAIGHTFORWARD PROCESS</p><h2>Three steps. <em>One plan.</em></h2></div><div class="steps"><article><span class="step-n">01</span><div><h3>Free tax evaluation.</h3><p>Start with a 30-minute conversation with Adam. If a closer look makes sense, we’ll send instructions for secure sharing of last year’s return afterward; never by ordinary email. Hazel can help flag potential planning opportunities, which we’ll review with you and your CPA as appropriate.</p></div></article><article><span class="step-n">02</span><div><h3>Align your team.</h3><p>Your CPA, insurance agent, estate attorney and investments should all be working from the same plan. We get everyone on the same page and keep them there.</p></div></article><article><span class="step-n">03</span><div><h3>Fill the gaps.</h3><p>No estate plan? Insurance nobody's looked at in years? We bring in trusted specialists we work with, so nothing falls through the cracks.</p></div></article></div><p class="caution">If a return evaluation follows your introductory call, AI-assisted findings are preliminary planning observations, not a completed tax analysis or a guarantee of tax savings. Your CPA remains your tax adviser.</p></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE WORK WE DO</p><h2>Financial planning that <em>speaks your language.</em></h2></div><div class="services">{services.map(([n,title,description],i)=><article><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">{n}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p>{i===2&&<a href="#transition" class="inline">Plan your transition →</a>}</article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section tools-bg"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">TWO TOOLS WORTH KNOWING ABOUT</p><h2>Know your options. <em>Know the trade-offs.</em></h2></div><div class="tool-grid"><article><p class="tag">TAX-AWARE INVESTING</p><h3>Direct indexing: own the index, control the taxes.</h3><p>Instead of buying a fund, you own the individual stocks inside it. When some of them drop, we can sell those to capture a loss that may offset gains elsewhere, while keeping you invested in the market. Similar broad market exposure, with more control over how taxable gains and losses are managed.</p><p class="risk"><em>Tax-loss harvesting does not guarantee a better outcome, and tax benefits depend on your situation. Talk with your CPA. Direct indexing can differ from an index and may involve additional costs.</em></p></article><article><p class="tag">DEFINED-OUTCOME INVESTMENTS</p><h3>Structured notes: know the trade-off up front.</h3><p>Some money needs to grow without taking every hit the market throws. Certain structured notes can be designed for potential income or growth, with a buffer against specified market declines up to a defined point. The terms spell out how potential payments and losses are calculated.</p><p class="risk"><em>Structured notes are subject to the issuer's credit risk, can lose principal if markets fall past the protection level, may limit upside, and may be difficult to sell before maturity. Payments are not guaranteed.</em></p></article></div></div></section>
<section id="transition" class="transition"><div class="wrap transition-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2>You'll only sell your business once. <em>Plan it like it.</em></h2><p>Whether you're selling to a buyer, passing it to family, or handing the keys to your crew, the decisions that matter most happen years before closing: how the sale is taxed, what you'll live on afterward, and what happens to your people. We start early, work with your CPA and attorney, and make sure the check you get is considered in a plan for your future income.</p><a class="button light" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Talk through my exit plan ↗</a></div><div class="transition-video" id="transition-video"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span><strong>Planning your exit</strong><small>Video coming soon</small></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap start" id="start"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO BEGIN</p><h2>Pick your <em>starting point.</em></h2></div><div class="offer-grid"><article class="offer primary-offer" id="tax-evaluation"><span class="offer-kicker">RECOMMENDED FIRST STEP</span><h3>Free tax evaluation.</h3><p>Wondering whether you may be missing tax-planning opportunities? Start with a free 30-minute conversation. After we connect, Adam will arrange a secure method for you to share last year’s return if you both decide an evaluation is appropriate. Hazel can help identify areas to discuss; we work alongside your CPA, not in place of them.</p><div class="secure-info"><span aria-hidden="true">♧</span><p><strong>Talk first. Share documents securely afterward.</strong> We’ll provide secure document-sharing instructions after we connect. Never send tax returns through a regular email or this website.</p></div><a class="button primary" id="tax-booking-link" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="tax">Request my free tax evaluation ↗</a><p class="placeholder-note" id="upload-note">First, book a conversation. If a return review makes sense, we’ll coordinate secure sharing afterward. No documents are needed to book.</p></article><article class="offer secondary-offer"><span class="offer-kicker">NO DOCUMENTS REQUIRED</span><h3>Not ready to share a return?</h3><p>Take the 2-minute quiz: <strong>Is your money working as hard as you do?</strong></p><p>Seven quick questions. See your personalized starting point privately, with no email required.</p><a class="button outline" href="#quiz">Take the quiz →</a></article></div></section>
<section class="section wrap quiz-section" id="quiz"><div class="quiz-shell"><div class="quiz-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">TWO-MINUTE QUIZ</p><h2>Is your money working <em>as hard as you do?</em></h2><p>Seven questions. No financial statements or email required. Your results stay on this page.</p></div><span class="quiz-time">About 2 minutes</span></div><div id="quiz-progress" class="quiz-progress"><span id="step-label">Question 1 of 7</span><div class="track"><i id="progress-fill"></i></div></div><div id="quiz-content"><h3 class="question-title">{first.title}</h3><p class="hint">{first.hint}</p><div class="options">{first.options.map((a,i)=><button type="button" data-answer={i}>{a}</button>)}</div></div><p class="fine">Educational starting point only; not personalized investment, tax or legal advice.</p></div><section id="results" hidden aria-live="polite"></section></section>
<section id="booking" class="booking"><div class="wrap booking-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET'S GET EVERYONE ON THE SAME PLAN</p><h2>30 minutes. <em>A useful next step.</em></h2><p>No cheesy sales process. We’ll talk through what’s on your mind, the people already on your team, and what might need a closer look. If we decide to review a tax return, we’ll arrange secure sharing after the call.</p></div><div class="booking-action"><a id="booking-link" class="button primary" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Book my 30-minute call ↗</a><p id="booking-note" class="placeholder-note">Calendly reserves 30 minutes. No documents required beforehand.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap about" id="about"><div class="about-photo"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam.webp" alt="Adam Kasick, financial adviser at RIPL Wealth" width="640" height="640" loading="lazy"/><span>Adam Kasick · RIPL Wealth</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">MEET YOUR FINANCIAL GC</p><h2>A business owner <em>in your corner.</em></h2><p>I'm Adam Kasick with RIPL Wealth in Fort Collins. I'm a business owner too, so I know your time is valuable. No cheesy sales process. My goal is for you to leave our 30-minute conversation with a clearer next step, whether or not we ever talk again.</p><blockquote>Successful people make great decisions when they can see their options clearly.</blockquote><div class="credential"><strong>Experience you can verify</strong><p>Investment advisory services through RIPL Wealth, LLC, a registered investment adviser. Adam has passed the Series 7 and Series 66 securities examinations. Client accounts are custodied through Altruist.</p><p><a href="https://adviserinfo.sec.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify adviser registration ↗</a> <a href="https://brokercheck.finra.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check BrokerCheck ↗</a></p></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap library" id="videos"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">WATCH & LEARN</p><h2>Questions real <em>owners ask.</em></h2><p>Short videos organized around where you are in building, growing, transitioning and using your wealth.</p></div><div class="video-filter" id="filters" aria-label="Video categories"><button type="button" class="active" data-stage="All" aria-pressed="true">All</button>{stages.map(s=><button type="button" data-stage={s} aria-pressed="false">{s}</button>)}</div><div id="video-grid" class="video-grid">{videos.map(v=><article class="video-card" data-video-stage={v.stage}><div class="video-thumb"><img loading="lazy" src={v.youtubeId?`https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.youtubeId}/hqdefault.jpg`:'/money-at-work/images/adam.webp'} alt=""/><span>{v.youtubeId?'▶':'Soon'}</span></div><div><span class="tag">{v.stage}</span><h3>{v.title}</h3><p>{v.summary}</p>{v.youtubeId?<a href={`https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=${v.youtubeId}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the video ↗</a>:<span class="video-soon">Video coming soon</span>}<p class="risk">{v.risk}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
